        1514,
        2122
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "c. The following City agencies and divisions of the Office of the Mayor shall participate on the Task Force: the Department of General Services, the Department of Environmental Protection, the Law Department, the Department of Employment, the Office of the Deputy Mayor for Planning and Development, the Mayor's Office of Operations, the Mayor's Office of Management and Budget, the Mayor's Office of Contracts, the Mayor's Office of City Legislative Affairs, and the Office of Economic Planning and Marketing. The head of each participating entity shall designate a senior official to serve on the Task Force.",
